	<div id="text-1906669975" class="text">
		
<h2>The &#8220;Blizzard Experience&#8221;</h2>
		
<style>
#text-1906669975 {
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: rgb(0, 124, 212);
}
#text-1906669975 > * {
  color: rgb(0, 124, 212);
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p>At Blizzard HVAC and Electrical, we&#8217;re all about &#8220;The Blizzard Experience.&#8221; It&#8217;s not just something we say, it&#8217;s a commitment we stick to in every part of what we do. From chatting with our awesome customer service team to getting your custom heat pump installations installed to perfection and providing ongoing support, we ensure that every customer not only gets but fully embraces the Blizzard experience. Our goal is to give you a smooth and personalised journey that sets us apart. When you roll with Blizzard, you&#8217;re getting nothing but the full Blizzard Experience. Our high quality standards complement our customer satisfaction.</p>
	<div id="gap-2008353921" class="gap-element clearfix" style="display:block; height:auto;">
		
<style>
#gap-2008353921 {
  padding-top: 10px;
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<a href="tel:044999649" class="button primary lowercase" style="border-radius:10px;padding:15px 20px 15px 20px;">
	<i class="icon-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>	<span>Call Blizzard Today</span>
	</a>

<a href="https://blizzard.co.nz/schedule-quote/" class="button primary is-outline lowercase" style="border-radius:10px;padding:15px 20px 15px 20px;">
		<span>Request An Appointment</span>
	</a>

