  font-size: 1.35rem;
  color: #007cd4;
}
#text-2929405240 > * {
  color: #007cd4;
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p>Blizzard is a family owned and operated business located in Upper hutt, Wellington. We are experts in all types of HVAC &amp; Electrical installations, repairs and service. Our highly trained team have been providing unmatched services and quality workmanship to cater to our customers needs in homes and businesses across the Wellington Region since 2016, Blizzard HVAC &amp; Electrical has fast become an industry leader in the supply, installation, service and maintenance of HVAC and Electrical systems/products. Blizzard has major backing by the highest quality manufacturers in our industry.</p>
