	<div id="text-1657528732" class="text">
		
<pre class="ti-widget"><div style="opacity: 0;height: 0 !important;overflow: hidden !important" data-css-url="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/trustindex-google-widget.css?1787121925" class=" ti-widget  ti-goog ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-time-locale="%d %s ago|today|day|days|week|weeks|month|months|year|years" data-plugin-version="14.1.1" data-layout-id="5" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="light-background" data-pid="wp-widget" data-language="en" data-close-locale="Close" data-review-target-width="275" data-css-version="2" data-reply-by-locale="Owner&apos;s reply" data-only-rating-locale="This user only left a rating." data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-4"> <div class="ti-footer ti-footer-grid source-Google"> <div class="ti-fade-container"> <div class="ti-rating-text"> <strong class="ti-rating ti-rating-large"> EXCELLENT </strong> </div> <span class="ti-stars star-lg"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /></span> <div class="ti-rating-text"> <span class="nowrap">Based on <strong>274 reviews</strong></span> </div> <div class="ti-large-logo"> <div class="ti-v-center"> <img decoding="async" class="ti-logo-fb skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/logo.svg" width="150" height="25"  alt="Google" /> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper">  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774656000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhHqsfN8yId9FyFgqIFdp9dvdQoZ6VghLv4kHlE63yCfCYPQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJhHqsfN8yId9FyFgqIFdp9dvdQoZ6VghLv4kHlE63yCfCYPQ=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100 2x" alt="Paul Jackson profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Paul Jackson </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Blizzard replaced our old home system when it failed, extended the system when we renovated, and have serviced the  system annually. They have quoted for other projects I have been involved with and been chosen as the preferred provider based on competitive pricing, system design, and planning.Their service has been excellent over the last 8 years.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774656000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIW7Rxl22SMekmCt8EiznvC73es0N6gUvGY08-O7T0W-muhBg=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIW7Rxl22SMekmCt8EiznvC73es0N6gUvGY08-O7T0W-muhBg=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="grace basinang profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> grace basinang </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Really satisfied with the work from Blizzard. The team did a great job — efficient, professional, and experienced. They left everything tidy once the installation was done, which I really appreciated. Customer service was excellent throughout the whole process. Overall, a smooth and positive experience.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774569600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKtJuv-kwhUervbi7SRRq81a2V2nUYilAPHMBkkM_FdeCaow=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIKtJuv-kwhUervbi7SRRq81a2V2nUYilAPHMBkkM_FdeCaow=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Andrew Pearson profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Andrew Pearson </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We had the team (James, Jayden, Josh , Harrison and others on site and Caitlin and Cheyan in the office) complete a full shift from gas to electric for us over the course of three days. This involved disconnecting and removing piped gas heater, infinity hot water and stovetop, and replacing with Daikin split heat pumps in three rooms, a Daikin CO₂ Hot Water System, and installing an induction stovetop. Also involved a full switchboard upgrade to futureproof for Solar. From getting the quotes, booking in the work and then having the team on site Blizzard were so easy to work with and had a high level of communication as the work went on. The team was happy to put in the long hours when a couple of difficulties with the install came up so that we could have heating and hot water for the evening. Fantastic that they could run the whole project for us including removing the old systems. A few days with the new setup and i'm really happy with it. I'd highly recommend Blizzard's services.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774569600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdpEXiFTpVfmAFmkCM8B6MWW5SBz3nLU0hmqx93j3Q303o-w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdpEXiFTpVfmAFmkCM8B6MWW5SBz3nLU0hmqx93j3Q303o-w=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Ben Porteous profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Ben Porteous </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Everything from getting a quote to installation went really well and we are very pleased with our heat pump. Jayden and James were friendly, efficient, on time and tidied up behind them. Great service.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774224000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKX6hDNuvf9oulmQv2EDhDbxi-59blPMjWrRqbvY2LfV3i0nA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKX6hDNuvf9oulmQv2EDhDbxi-59blPMjWrRqbvY2LfV3i0nA=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Andy Brown profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Andy Brown </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Blizzard did a great job installing Mums new heat pump. James was fantastic.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774137600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwzcZopeJMlJBIzK_f4QDKuLO0f0r0Hzn994b1h8907OkQrQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwzcZopeJMlJBIzK_f4QDKuLO0f0r0Hzn994b1h8907OkQrQ=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Barry Lerwill profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Barry Lerwill </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We had a maintenace done by Russell who was great!! Will use again .<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1774051200" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQaAfKN1f3ZDFV_paNZwJa_6gaYUdoPy7GcgRXhAQF52ZO3Q=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIQaAfKN1f3ZDFV_paNZwJa_6gaYUdoPy7GcgRXhAQF52ZO3Q=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba4-br100 2x" alt="manahi waikai profile picture"  /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> manahi waikai </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  /><img decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Thanks to James and Josh for the professional install of our heat pump. The team at Blizzard were great to deal with from start to finish.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1773964800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9