	<section class="section" id="section_1263891755">
		<div class="section-bg fill" >
									
			

		</div>

		

		<div class="section-content relative">
			
<div class="row align-equal"  id="row-759747277">

	<div id="col-966334761" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-4"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
	<div class="is-border"
		style="border-radius:30px;border-width:5px 5px 5px 5px;">
	</div>
			
  <div class="icon-box testimonial-box icon-box-center text-center">
                <div class="icon-box-img testimonial-image circle" style="width: 80px">
              <img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20150%20150'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" data-lazy-srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" data-lazy-src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></noscript>        </div>
                <div class="icon-box-text p-last-0">
            				<div class="testimonial-text line-height-small italic test_text first-reset last-reset is-italic">
            
<p style="font-style: normal;">The team at Blizzard are awesome &#8211; the office team were prompt setting up a viewing to make a quote, the quote appointment was informative and setting the installation date was easy. The team that did our ducted heat pump installation were organised, efficient, hardworking and polite. They communicated well about what they were doing and happily answered any questions/ shared their knowledge along the way. We were very impressed by the service from Blizzard and love our new heat pump system &#8211; just in time for the hot weather!! Totally recommend Blizzard!!</p>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-meta pt-half">
             <strong class="testimonial-name test_name">Caroline Bartley</strong>
                          <span class="testimonial-company test_company"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
  </div>

  
		</div>
					</div>

	

	<div id="col-1132299343" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-4"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
	<div class="is-border"
		style="border-radius:30px;border-width:5px 5px 5px 5px;">
	</div>
			
  <div class="icon-box testimonial-box icon-box-center text-center">
                <div class="icon-box-img testimonial-image circle" style="width: 80px">
              <img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20150%20150'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" data-lazy-srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" data-lazy-src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></noscript>        </div>
                <div class="icon-box-text p-last-0">
            				<div class="testimonial-text line-height-small italic test_text first-reset last-reset is-italic">
            
<p style="font-style: normal;">A++ Highly recommended team courteous and professional. Ticked all the boxes from initial enquiry to final sign off. Having received more than 6 quotes from various companies. We choose the Daikin 15Kw central heating system with airtouch5 and air ventilation add on. This was executed perfectly in our roof space with the massive outdoor unit neatly tucked away. Installation team were exceptional and very knowledgeable. They were able to bring an extra vent to our ground floor with minimal fuss with a can do attitude absent in others.<br />
Thanks team Blizzard !!</p>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-meta pt-half">
             <strong class="testimonial-name test_name">Vic Namasivayam</strong>
                          <span class="testimonial-company test_company"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
  </div>

  
		</div>
					</div>

	

	<div id="col-887355988" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-4"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
	<div class="is-border"
		style="border-radius:30px;border-width:5px 5px 5px 5px;">
	</div>
			
  <div class="icon-box testimonial-box icon-box-center text-center">
                <div class="icon-box-img testimonial-image circle" style="width: 80px">
              <img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20150%20150'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" data-lazy-srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" data-lazy-src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="150" height="150" src="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp" class="attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail" alt="" srcset="https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-150x150.png.webp 150w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1-100x100.png.webp 100w,https://blizzard.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Google-Review-1.png.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></noscript>        </div>
                <div class="icon-box-text p-last-0">
            				<div class="testimonial-text line-height-small italic test_text first-reset last-reset is-italic">
            
<p style="font-style: normal;">We got quotes from 4 companies to put a Ducted Heat Pump system in our home. Blizzard had the best solutions and options for our needs and also the best price.<br />
The wait time between pulling the trigger and beginning the installation was relatively quick. The team that did the install were really professional and easy to deal with. I was also very impressed by how quickly they worked &#8211; they knew what they were doing and there was no mucking around. It only took 2 days to install. I also called Blizzard about a week later to ask if the system could be tweaked and they came round at no extra cost. Really happy I went with Blizzard</p>
          </div>
          <div class="testimonial-meta pt-half">
             <strong class="testimonial-name test_name">Steve Moodie</strong>
                          <span class="testimonial-company test_company"></span>
          </div>
        </div>
  </div>

  
		</div>
					</div>

	

